        <span class="p-line p-l3">na roupa</span>
      </h1>

      <button class="p-glass p-glass-a" type="button" data-add="rolo">
        <span class="p-glass-photo"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#art-rolo" /></svg></span>
        <strong>Rolo removedor</strong>
